<p>President Trump sharply criticized several European allies on March 31, saying countries worried about energy supplies through the Strait of Hormuz should protect those routes themselves instead of relying on Washington. His remarks came as the U.S.-Iran war continued to disrupt tanker traffic and fuel markets, and after reports that some European governments had refused deeper military involvement or placed limits on U.S. and Israeli military flights through their airspace. Soon after the social media posts, Trump told CBS News he was not ready &quot;quite yet&quot; to end U.S. efforts to pressure Iran to reopen the strait, suggesting Washington had not fully stepped back despite his public frustration with allies. The exchange points to a widening strain within the Western alliance over how to respond to the Iran conflict, even as leaders on several sides continue to send signals that could still leave room for a negotiated off-ramp.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/-nN7jtuSU7WhomXbqIktB08tGAEPkyFlYMgCkMEQMNeJSRsePEFJv3_TM0Yr-cypgd-rTRY2ueyq3M2qmwGzVFAz-NmYL5kGtKhPK9KKSEyGfhMRm_zAu1S_IRs-abn23hjV2ccz0I5js45Q51HtZycqAzb_OOwT-kyKOKhx-Ce03eYY1lnRg_e2FRsnaSr3foVHjpEnhzQEKPtRjLKiAr6CvaUsmC5KsrWm0GCOzjHXHGZC' alt='President Trump arriving in Washington on Sunday. Mr. Trump criticized European allies on social media on Tuesday for their refusal to get more involved in the Iran War.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Jet fuel jab: Trump told allies struggling with jet fuel access because of the Strait of Hormuz to &quot;buy from the U.S., we have plenty,&quot; singling out the UK in particular.</li><li>Regional warning: Dawn said U.S. companies in the region received warnings as the conflict and supply disruption deepened.</li><li>Back-channel contact: Iranian Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi said Iran and the United States exchanged messages, while denying formal talks.</li><li>Fuel prices: CBS said gas prices rose above $4 a gallon in many U.S. states as disruption in the Strait of Hormuz added pressure to energy markets.</li></ul><blockquote>You’ll have to start learning how to fight for yourself, the U.S.A. won’t be there to help you anymore, just like you weren’t there for us. - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: He said countries that rely on energy moving through the Strait of Hormuz should carry more of the security burden themselves rather than expect the United States to act as Europe’s &quot;gatekeeper.&quot; (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-iran-strait-of-hormuz-not-ready-quite-yet-to-leave/'>CBS News</a>, <a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/trump-lashes-out-at-european-allies-over-strait-of-hormuz-im-not-a-gatekeeper-for-them/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>European governments: Several European governments said their refusal to join the campaign reflected legal and political opposition to a war they viewed as illegal, widening the split with Washington. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/31/trump-launches-tirade-against-european-countries-not-joining-iran-war'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Iranian government: Tehran said it wants the war to end, but only with guarantees that the conflict will not happen again. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1987353/buy-jet-fuel-from-us-or-get-your-own-trump-rails-against-allies'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/31/world/middleeast/trump-europe-iran-criticism.html'>Trump Lashes Out at Europe Over Strait of Hormuz, Tells U.K. to ‘Go Get Your Own Oil’</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-usa-israel-war-strait-of-hormuz-donald-trump/article70806863.ece'>Trump blasts allies, tells them ‘go get your own oil’</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1987353/buy-jet-fuel-from-us-or-get-your-own-trump-rails-against-allies'>Buy jet fuel from US or get your own, Trump rails against allies</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-iran-strait-of-hormuz-not-ready-quite-yet-to-leave/'>Trump says allies must &quot;come in and take care of&quot; Strait of Hormuz</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/watch-trump-says-other-nations-can-fend-for-themselves-in-strait-of-hormuz-after-u-s-leaves-iran'>WATCH: Trump says other nations can &#x27;fend for themselves&#x27; in Strait of Hormuz after U.S. leaves Iran</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1s95soc/trump_lashes_out_at_europe_as_growing_number_of/'>Trump lashes out at Europe as growing number of allies reject US calls for help</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/31/trump-launches-tirade-against-european-countries-not-joining-iran-war'>‘Get your own oil’: Trump launches tirade against Europe for not joining Iran war</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>